## Page 32

⑩ Football LLM / RAG Layer DELIVERY
PURPOSE Convert ranked, evidence-backed Domino Moments into natural-language tactical ex‐
planation.
RESPONSIBILITIES Retrieve relevant subgraph/evidence for a query or report; generate grounded,
citation-linked prose; answer free-form coach questions (Part IX).
INPUTS User query or report trigger; retrieved subgraph from Module ⑦; Domino Moment
evidence from Module ⑧.
OUTPUTS Natural-language explanation with citations back to specific graph nodes and video
timestamps.
INTERNAL AL‐
GORITHMS
Retrieval-augmented generation over the knowledge graph; function-calling into
Modules ⑦–⑨ for on-demand evidence lookup.
DEPENDENCIES Locally-hosted open-weight model (Llama/Qwen/Mistral family); Module ⑦ query in‐
terface.
FAILURE MODES Hallucinated claims not actually supported by retrieved evidence; over-confident
natural-language tone masking low underlying causal-confidence scores.
SCALABILITY Stateless request-response; scales horizontally behind Module ⑫ with standard LLM-
serving infrastructure.
FUTURE IM‐
PROVEMENTS
Fine-tuning on football-specific tactical vocabulary; automatic confidence-to-
language calibration so uncertain claims are phrased as such.
