FAILURE MODES Local hardware failure without automated cloud failover; manual air-gapped update bundle desynchronization.
SCALABILITY Appliance sized to club match and training volume; horizontally expandable via local network nodes.
FUTURE IMPROVEMENTS
Federated learning across consenting partner clubs enabling shared model weights without sharing proprietary raw video or tactical telemetry.

