15.6Database Schema Summary
Table 15.2 — Persistence layer, by store
Store Holds
PostgreSQL Match metadata, club/user accounts, subscription/billing, Sportscode instance tags
DuckDB / Parquet Full-frequency tracking coordinates (25 Hz S_t), 10–20 Hz GPS telemetry streams
Redis / Valkey API response cache, rate-limit counters, live-session state, War-Room WebSocket state
Qdrant / Milvus Player/play-style embeddings, memory-retrieval vectors (§5.8, Module ⑥)
Neo4j / AGE The Football Knowledge Graph in full (Part VIII), set-piece screening interaction graphs
MinIO / SeaweedFS Raw broadcast video, multi-angle feeds, player micro-clip MP4s, model checkpoints
